                                                "sense_id": "3a75e329-f054-3c61-bc8f-b2001771aade",
                                                "text": "Now, Marie de Livinhac, a company in the Auvergne region, is making a dehydrated aligot mix that requires only crème fraîche, water and five minutes’ time."
                                            }
